    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it's not just quiet, it's heavy. like i'm underwater. i look at his things and it just makes me realize that i'm the only one left to carry all this memory. it feels so pointless to just keep dragging myself through the days when the person i wanted to share them with is gone.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
